{
  "version": 1,
  "minor_version": 1,
  "key": "lovelace.reseau_infra",
  "data": {
    "config": {
      "title": "Réseau & Infra",
      "background": {
        "image": "/local/images/wallpaper/reseau.jpg",
        "size": "cover",
        "attachment": "fixed"
      },
      "views": [
        {
          "title": "Réseau & Infra",
          "path": "reseau-it",
          "icon": "mdi:lan",
          "type": "sections",
          "max_columns": 4,
          "header": {
            "card": {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "# 🌐 Réseau & Infra\nInternet · Wi-Fi · Switches · Débit",
              "text_only": true,
              "card_mod": {
                "style": "ha-card { background: rgba(25, 18, 38, 0.72) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important; box-shadow: none !important; padding: 12px 20px !important; } ha-markdown { text-align: center !important; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.95), 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,1) !important; color: #f6d68a !important; }\n"
              }
            }
          },
          "sections": [
            {
              "type": "grid",
              "column_span": 4,
              "cards": [
                {
                  "type": "custom:button-card",
                  "template": "cc_title",
                  "name": "Internet — Ligne principale & secours",
                  "icon": "mdi:label-outline",
                  "variables": {
                    "sub": "",
                    "lights": []
                  },
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": "full",
                    "rows": "auto"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "## 📡 Connexion active : {% if is_state('binary_sensor.r_wan2_core_liaison_internet_du_port_2', 'on') %}🟢 **Orange (VOO)**{% else %}🟠 **Carte SIM Digi (secours)**{% endif %}",
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": 48,
                    "rows": "auto"
                  },
                  "card_mod": {
                    "style": "ha-card{background:rgba(38,28,58,.55)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-radius:16px!important;border:1px solid rgba(246,214,138,.22)!important;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(12,8,22,.75)!important;margin-bottom:6px}\nha-card { background: rgba(38, 28, 58, 0.55) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important; -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important; border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; } ha-markdown { text-align: center !important; }\n"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "conditional",
                  "conditions": [
                    {
                      "entity": "binary_sensor.r_wan2_core_liaison_internet_du_port_2",
                      "state": "off"
                    }
                  ],
                  "card": {
                    "type": "markdown",
                    "content": "## ⚠️ Internet sur ligne de secours (4G)\nLa ligne principale VOO/Orange est coupée. Le trafic passe par\nla carte SIM du routeur.\n",
                    "card_mod": {
                      "style": "ha-card{background:rgba(38,28,58,.55)!important;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-radius:16px!important;border:1px solid rgba(246,214,138,.22)!important;box-shadow:0 4px 0 rgba(12,8,22,.75)!important;margin-bottom:6px}\nha-card { background: rgba(120, 30, 30, 0.45) !important; backdrop-filter: blur(16px) !important; } ha-markdown { text-align: center !important; }\n"
                    }
                  },
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": 48,
                    "rows": "auto"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "custom:mushroom-template-card",
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.r_wan2_core_liaison_internet_du_port_2",
                  "primary": "Ligne principale (VOO/Orange)",
                  "secondary": "{{ 'Connecté' if is_state(entity,'on') else 'Déconnecté' }}",
                  "icon": "mdi:cable-data",
